      keyPoints: [
        "Content is ~90% of SEO — structure it as main topics (pillars) and supporting subtopics (clusters).",
        "Pillar pages are your main landing pages; cluster content supports them and links back coherently.",
        "Use SEMrush to find pillar keywords and related clusters, then map the site around them.",
        "Internal links from clusters to pillar pages (with relevant anchor text) pass keyword and link value.",
        "Optimize with a tool like Surfer SEO, and keep refining as new keyword research comes in.",
      ],
      showBody: true,
